{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124291","id":4789905772,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHYApbA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124291","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124291.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124291.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124291","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124291/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124291/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124291/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d84b929a63ff0b875e389362352b4b6835463d48","number":124291,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix missing resource UIDs from `ResourceSaver`","user":{"login":"1hue","id":212147609,"node_id":"U_kgDODKUdmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212147609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue","html_url":"https://github.com/1hue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1hue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`ResourceSaver` skips uids for `[ext_resource]` references. This is inconsistent with how a `.tscn` stores it:\r\n```ini\r\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" uid=\"uid://co1jtfqqh4rq0\" path=\"res://child.tres\" id=\"2_0xm2m\"]\r\n```\r\nInstead we get:\r\n```ini\r\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://child.tres\" id=\"2_0xm2m\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- Closes: godotengine/godot/issues/124319\r\n\r\n### Underlying cause\r\n\r\n`ResourceSaver` accepts a uid finder *callback* via [`set_get_resource_id_for_path`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/core/io/resource_saver.cpp#L292) which is happily utilized by the [`EditorFileSystem`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L3801).\r\n\r\nThe problem arises when it's not the editor writing a `.tscn`, but a runtime writing a `.tres`, hence no uid finder callback.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 releas